1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,470
God sees exactly where you are right now. Even when you feel invisible, He knows your name. Sometimes we think God has forgotten us because our prayers feel silent.

2
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:24,670
But silence does not mean absence. God is working in ways you cannot see yet. He is moving behind the scenes, arranging things for your good.

3
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:38,500
Do not give up on what God started in your life. Do not lose hope when things take longer than expected. Your breakthrough is closer than you realize.

4
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:51,820
Keep trusting even when it is hard. Keep believing even when you cannot see the way forward. God is faithful even when we cannot feel His hand.

5
00:00:54,820 --> 00:01:01,469
He is with you in the waiting. Thank you for listening. This is The Open Door with Eden.

